  "title": "Make a Neural Network (FNN)",
  "date": "2026-07-04T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Make a Neural Network (FNN)\n\nThis is the AI course from Fudan University by 徐辉\n\nUsing Neural Network to predict factorial numbers\n\n$$\nx! = \\prod\\_{i=1}^{x} i.\n$$\n\nIn case of overflow, the study changed to the log value.\n\n$$\nlog(x!)= log(\\prod\\_{i=1}^{x} i)=\\sum^{x}\\_{i=1}log(i)\n$$\n\nThe study uses feed-forward neural network(FNN) to predict the numbers.\nIt introduces 2 activation functions, sigmoid function and ReLU(Rectified Linear Unit).\n\n$$\n\\sigma(z\\_{\\text{sigmoid}}) = \\frac{1}{1+e^{-z}}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\sigma(z\\_{\\text{ReLU}}) = max(0, z)\n$$\n\nEvery neurons is represented as:\n\n$$\nh\\_i = \\sigma(w1\\_{i} \\cdot x + b1\\_i)\n$$\n\nThe predicted result is:\n\n$$\n^{y} = \\sum\\_{i=1}^nw2\\_{i} \\cdot h\\_i + b2\n$$\n\nThe result",
